      "writtenOn": "2025-03-28T17:58:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unless the `SkMatrix` returns true from `rectStaysRect()`, `mapRect()` returns a bounding box of the transformed corners of the input rect. To keep things simple, I think we\u0027d just skip going through `drawImageRect` if there was a matrix index set.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2734,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2734,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "503b56a495d1becb5a2ac2562534a879289605c8",
