        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-28T17:58:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we\u0027re inside the autolayer, we should call `this-\u003etopDevice()-\u003edrawEdgeAAQuad(...)`. `this-\u003etopDevice()` returns the SkDevice that was created for the auto layer and we don\u0027t want to go through more SkCanvas virtuals.\n\nSince we can\u0027t call `mapRect` to apply any preview matrix and `drawEdgeAAQuad` doesn\u0027t take an optional matrix, we can modify the local-to-device matrix of the layer\u0027s top device:\n\n    this-\u003etopDevice()-\u003esetLocalToDevice(this-\u003etopDevice()-\u003elocalToDevice44() * SkM44(preViewMatrices[index]));\n    \nThe auto layer will get rid of the device right after the draw, so there\u0027s no need to restore the transform.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2750,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 2750,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "503b56a495d1becb5a2ac2562534a879289605c8",
